"space-y-4\"><h1 class=\"text-5xl md:text-7xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase italic\">Mentions <span class=\"text-yellow-400\">Légales</span></h1><p class=\"text-white/40 font-medium tracking-wide uppercase text-sm\">Informations obligatoires concernant l'éditeur et l'hébergeur du site.</p></div><div class=\"grid gap-6\"><div class=\"shadcn-card rounded-xl border text-card-foreground shadow-sm bg-white/5 border-white/10 overflow-hidden\"><div class=\"flex flex-col space-y-1.5 p-6 border-b border-white/5 bg-white/[0.02]\"><div class=\"tracking-tight text-xl font-black flex items-center gap-3\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-building2 w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400\"><path d=\"M6 22V4a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h8a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v18Z\"></path><path d=\"M6 12H4a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v6a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h2\"></path><path d=\"M18 9h2a2 2 0 0 1 2 2v9a2 2 0 0 1-2 2h-2\"></path><path d=\"M10 6h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 10h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 14h4\"></path><path d=\"M10 18h4\"></path></svg>ÉDITEUR DU SITE</div></div><div class=\"p-6 pt-8 pb-8 space-y-6 text-white/70\"><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-8\"><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">Dénomination Sociale</p><p class=\"text-lg font-bold text-white\">CrediaCreation</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">Forme Juridique</p><p class=\"text-white font-medium\">Micro entrepreneur</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">Immatriculation</p><p class=\"text-white font-medium\">SIRET : 803 822 287 00022</p></div></div><div class=\"space-y-4\"><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">Siège Social</p><p class=\"text-white font-medium flex items-start gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-map-pin w-4 h-4 text-yellow-400 shrink-0 mt-1\"><path d=\"M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0\"></path><circle cx=\"12\" cy=\"10\" r=\"3\"></circle></svg>9C Rue du Général de Gaulle, 76770 Le Houlme, France</p></div><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-[10px] font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-white/30\">Contact</p><p class=\"text-white font-medium flex items-center gap-2\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-mail w-4 h-4 text-yellow-400\"><rect width=\"20\" height=\"16\" x=\"2\" y=\"4\" rx=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"m22 7-8.97 5.7a1.94 1.94 0 0 1-2.06 0L2 7\"></path></svg>credia.contact@gmail.com</p></div></div></div></div><section class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01]\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 italic uppercase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-shield w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400\"><path d=\"M20 13c0 5-3.5 7.5-7.66 8.95a1 1 0 0 1-.67-.01C7.5 20.5 4 18 4 13V6a1 1 0 0 1 1-1c2 0 4.5-1.2 6.24-2.72a1.17 1.17 0 0 1 1.52 0C14.51 3.81 17 5 19 5a1 1 0 0 1 1 1z\"></path></svg>Hébergement</h2><div class=\"space-y-1\"><p class=\"text-white font-bold\">Vercel Inc.</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">440 N Barranca Ave #4133 Covina, CA 91723</p><p class=\"text-white/60 text-sm\">États-Unis</p></div></section><section class=\"p-8 border-t border-white/5 bg-white/[0.01]\"><h2 class=\"text-xl font-black mb-4 flex items-center gap-3 italic uppercase\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-refresh-ccw w-5 h-5 text-yellow-400\"><path d=\"M21 12a9 9 0 0 0-9-9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0-6.74 2.74L3 8\"></path><path d=\"M3 3v5h5\"></path><path d=\"M3 12a9 9 0 0 0 9 9 9.75 9.75 0 0 0 6.74-2.74L21 16\"></path><path d=\"M16 16h5v5\"></path></svg>Politique de Remboursement</h2><div class=\"space-y-4 text-white/70 text-sm leading-relaxed\"><p>Conformément à notre politique commerciale, un remboursement peut être accordé sous réserve du respect des conditions suivantes :</p><ul class=\"space-y-3 list-none\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400 font-black text-lg leading-none mt-0.5\">1.</span><span><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Délai de demande :</span> La demande de remboursement doit être effectuée dans un délai maximum de <span class=\"text-white font-bold\">48 heures</span> suivant la date d'achat (abonnement, pack de crédits ou tout autre produit numérique).</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400 font-black text-lg leading-none mt-0.5\">2.</span><span><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Aucun crédit utilisé :</span> Le remboursement n'est possible que si <span class=\"text-white font-bold\">aucun crédit n'a été consommé</span> depuis l'achat. Toute utilisation, même partielle, des crédits rend le remboursement impossible.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400 font-black text-lg leading-none mt-0.5\">3.</span><span><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Abonnement non résilié :</span> toute personne ayant résilié ou annulé son abonnement n'est pas éligible au remboursement, y compris pour la période déjà payée.</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><span class=\"text-yellow-400 font-black text-lg leading-none mt-0.5\">4.</span><span><span class=\"text-white font-bold\">Procédure :</span> Pour effectuer une demande de remboursement, contactez-nous par e-mail à <a href=\"mailto:credia.contact@gmail.com\" class=\"text-yellow-400 hover:text-yellow-300 font-bold underline underline-offset-2\">credia.contact@gmail.com</a> en précisant votre adresse e-mail de compte et la raison de votre demande.</span></li></ul><p class=\"text-white/40 text-xs mt-4\">Passé le délai de 48 heures, en cas de consommation de crédits ou de résiliation de l'abonnement, aucun remboursement ne pourra être effectué. Les produits numériques étant accessibles immédiatement après l'achat, le droit de rétractation de 14 jours prévu par le Code de la consommation ne s'applique pas, conformément à l'article L221-28 du Code de la consommation.</p></div></section></div></div></div></div><div class=\"fixed bottom-20 right-4 z-50\" style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><div class=\"relative overflow-visible\"><button class=\"inline-flex items-center justify-center gap-2 whitespace-nowrap text-sm font-medium focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-1 focus-visible:ring-ring disabled:pointer-events-none disabled:opacity-50 [&amp;_svg]:pointer-events-none [&amp;_svg]:size-4 [&amp;_svg]:shrink-0 hover-elevate active-elevate-2 bg-primary border border-primary-border relative w-10 h-10 rounded-full shadow-2xl bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-500 to-cyan-500 text-white hover:scale-110 transition-transform border-none\" data-testid=\"button-general-chat\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-message-square w-5 h-5\"><path d=\"M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z\"></path></svg></button><span class=\"absolute -top-1.5 -right-1.5 z-[60] min-w-[22px] h-[22px] px-1 bg-red-600 text-white text-[10px] font-black leading-none rounded-full flex items-center justify-center shadow-[0_0_10px_rgba(220,38,38,0.8)] ring-2 ring-black pointer-events-none\" data-testid=\"badge-unread-count\" aria-label=\"Messages non lus\">99+</span></div></div><div role=\"region\" aria-label=\"Notifications (F8)\" tabindex=\"-1\" style=\"pointer-events: none;\"><ol tabindex=\"-1\" class=\"fixed top-0 z-[100] flex max-h-screen w-full flex-col-reverse p-4 sm:bottom-0 sm:right-0 sm:top-auto sm:flex-col md:max-w-[420px]\"></ol></div></div></div>\n  \n<div class=\"crisp-client\" aria-live=\"polite\" translate=\"no\" tabindex=\"-1\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\" style=\"--crisp-color-theme-100: 255, 240, 193; --crisp-color-theme-200: 102, 120, 138; --crisp-color-theme-500: 225, 174, 1; --crisp-color-theme-600: 205, 158, 0; --crisp-color-theme-700: 196, 151, 0; --crisp-color-theme-800: 184, 142, 0; --crisp-color-theme-900: 163, 126, 0; --crisp-color-theme-reverse: 255, 255, 255;\"><div class=\"cc-11i2a\"></div><div class=\"cc-165wh\" id=\"crisp-chatbox\" data-hidden=\"false\" data-force-show=\"false\" data-color-mode=\"light\" data-availability=\"away\" data-presentation=\"default\" data-lock-maximized=\"false\" data-website-logo=\"false\" data-last-operator-face=\"false\" data-ongoing-operator-face=\"false\" data-availability-tooltip=\"false\" data-hide-vacation=\"false\" data-blocked=\"false\" data-mobile-view=\"false\" data-full-view=\"false\" data-small-view=\"false\" data-large-view=\"true\" data-has-local-messages=\"false\" data-was-availability-online=\"false\" data-is-activity-ongoing=\"false\" data-hide-on-away=\"false\" data-hide-on-mobile=\"false\" data-position-reverse=\"false\"><div class=\"cc-lk42u cc-2ob4j cc-1sof5 cc-y7mhy\"><div class=\"cc-13wro\" data-maximized=\"false\" data-is-failure=\"false\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"button\" aria-label=\"Open chat\" data-pane-animate-entra